 CM_ BO_ 51 "FlexRay EPS angle frame. Raw steering angle lives in word B as bytes 3:4 little-endian and only the active subframes where byte0&0x3 is 0 or 2 carry angle content. Subframes 1 and 3 are structurally empty.";
CM_ SG_ 51 EPS_STEERING_ANGLE_BMW "Primary FlexRay EPS steering-angle candidate from raw word B at 24|16@1+ interpreted little-endian. Global refit against the legacy CAN steering angle on 0x302 across routes 0x401 and 0x402: angle_deg ~= raw_B * 0.042420980556 - 1390.727380850223. Apply only on active cycles 0/2; cycles 1/3 should be treated as empty subframes.";

