CM_ BO_ 56 "Confirmed vehicle-dynamics helper. Raw yaw fields remain useful for reverse-engineering and stock lateral comparison work. The late word at bytes 11..12 is kept only as a secondary steering-angle debug/support candidate now that frame 51 is promoted.";
CM_ SG_ 56 STEERING_ANGLE_PROXY_56_RAW "Secondary debug/support steering-angle proxy from route 00000402 fitting against PT-CAN 770. Keep for analysis only; no longer the primary steeringAngleDeg source.";
CM_ SG_ 56 STEERING_ANGLE_PROXY_56_DEG "Debug/support steering-angle estimate derived from STEERING_ANGLE_PROXY_56_RAW using the historical fit angle_deg ~= 0.0260328634 * raw56 - 851.998806. Not the primary steeringAngleDeg source anymore.";

