CM_ BO_ 40 "Production drive-state frame. Cross-check against dynm BMW SP2018 FlexRay DBC shows this frame is the closest local match to their maybe_gear_switch frame, and current i3 routes support using its cycle_count plus the byte-11/byte-14 discriminator path as the primary FlexRay gear source in CarState.";

