CM_ BO_ 72 "Raw stock frame-72 candidate, reintroduced for parameter-by-parameter comparison against the SP2018 72-byte layout. Current fixed synthetic blocks: cycle_count = 0x00, crc1 = 0x00 with real final CRC to be computed later outside the DBC, cnt1 = 0x00, always_0x9 placeholder = 0xF, steering_angle_req placeholder = 0x0000, steer_torque_req placeholder = 0xFFFF, TJA_ready placeholder = 0xFF, assist_mode placeholder = 0xE0, wayback_en1_lane_keeping_trigger placeholder = 0xFF, lane_keeping_triggered placeholder = 0xFF, like_assist_torque_reserve placeholder = 0xFF, constants placeholder = 0x3FFFF, wayback_en_2 placeholder = 0x3, steering_engaged placeholder = 0xF. For blocks 3-14, firmware currently preserves the live OEM payload bytes from the cached 72 template.";
CM_ SG_ 72 LAT_STOCK_72_CYCLE_COUNT "Block 1 candidate on local frame 72. Current synthetic decision: use a fixed value of 0x00 when building a local 72 frame, matching the simpler dynm-style approach instead of waiting on OEM live timing.";
CM_ SG_ 72 LAT_STOCK_72_CRC1 "Block 2 candidate on local frame 72. Current synthetic decision: keep this DBC-visible crc1 field at 0x00 and compute any real final CRC later outside the DBC, dynm-style.";
CM_ SG_ 72 LAT_STOCK_72_CNT1 "Block 3 candidate on local frame 72 in the same positional slot as SP2018 cnt1. Current synthetic decision: fix it to 0x00, matching SMNOGAR/dynm builder behavior.";
CM_ SG_ 72 LAT_STOCK_72_ALWAYS_0X9 "Block 4 candidate on local frame 72 in the same positional slot as SP2018 always_0x9. Placeholder decision in DBC/controller: set to 0xF if synthesized locally. Firmware currently preserves the live OEM high nibble of byte2 from the cached 72 template, so the placeholder is not the final bus value.";
CM_ SG_ 72 LAT_STOCK_72_STEERING_ANGLE_REQ "Block 5 candidate in the same positional slot as SP2018 steering_angle_req. Placeholder decision in DBC/controller: set to 0x0000 if synthesized locally. Firmware currently preserves the live OEM bytes 3:4 from the cached 72 template, so this placeholder is not the final bus value.";
CM_ SG_ 72 LAT_STOCK_72_STEER_TORQUE_REQ "Block 6 candidate in the same positional slot as SP2018 steer_torque_req. Placeholder decision in DBC/controller: set to 0xFFFF if synthesized locally. Firmware currently preserves the live OEM bytes 5:6 from the cached 72 template, so this placeholder is not the final bus value.";
CM_ SG_ 72 LAT_STOCK_72_TJA_READY "Block 7 candidate in the same positional slot as SP2018 TJA_ready. Placeholder decision in DBC/controller: set to 0xFF if synthesized locally. Firmware currently preserves the live OEM byte7 from the cached 72 template, so this placeholder is not the final bus value.";
CM_ SG_ 72 LAT_STOCK_72_ASSIST_MODE "Block 8 candidate in the same positional slot as SP2018 assist_mode. Placeholder decision in DBC/controller: set to 0xE0 if synthesized locally. Firmware currently preserves the live OEM byte8 from the cached 72 template, so this placeholder is not the final bus value.";
CM_ SG_ 72 LAT_STOCK_72_WAYBACK_EN1_LANE_KEEPING_TRIGGER "Block 9 candidate in the same positional slot as SP2018 wayback_en1_lane_keeping_trigger. Placeholder decision in DBC/controller: set to 0xFF if synthesized locally. Firmware currently preserves the live OEM byte9 from the cached 72 template, so this placeholder is not the final bus value.";
CM_ SG_ 72 LAT_STOCK_72_LANE_KEEPING_TRIGGERED "Block 10 candidate in the same positional slot as SP2018 lane_keeping_triggered. Placeholder decision in DBC/controller: set to 0xFF if synthesized locally. Firmware currently preserves the live OEM byte10 from the cached 72 template, so this placeholder is not the final bus value.";
CM_ SG_ 72 LAT_STOCK_72_LIKE_ASSIST_TORQUE_RESERVE "Block 11 candidate in the same positional slot as SP2018 like_assist_torque_reserve. Placeholder decision in DBC/controller: set to 0xFF if synthesized locally. Firmware currently preserves the live OEM byte11 from the cached 72 template, so this placeholder is not the final bus value.";
CM_ SG_ 72 LAT_STOCK_72_CONSTANTS "Block 12 candidate in the same positional slot as SP2018 constants. Placeholder decision in DBC/controller: set to 0x3FFFF if synthesized locally. Firmware currently preserves the live OEM bytes 12:14 (including the low 2 bits of byte14) from the cached 72 template, so this placeholder is not the final bus value.";
CM_ SG_ 72 LAT_STOCK_72_WAYBACK_EN_2 "Block 13 candidate in the same positional slot as SP2018 wayback_en_2. Placeholder decision in DBC/controller: set to 0x3 if synthesized locally. Firmware already preserves the live OEM byte14 from the cached 72 template, so this placeholder is not the final bus value.";
CM_ SG_ 72 LAT_STOCK_72_STEERING_ENGAGED "Block 14 candidate in the same positional slot as SP2018 steering_engaged. Placeholder decision in DBC/controller: set to 0xF if synthesized locally. Firmware already preserves the live OEM byte14 from the cached 72 template, so this placeholder is not the final bus value.";

