CM_ BO_ 116 "Secondary lateral RX/state helper. Confirmed on historical routes 00000054 and 00000055, present on the modern interface in route 000000b3, and strengthened by managed-TJA route 00000176. Historical logs exposed it on src23; modern dual-FlexRay logging exposes the same frame on src1. It tracks the same assisted-steering phases as 112 and is the best current secondary helper for stock lateral command/echo analysis. Byte5 is not yet a standalone boolean, but it moves through stable phase families alongside 112 and is logged as support evidence for the live stock_lat_active_hint path.";
CM_ SG_ 116 LAT_STOCK_SUPPORT_BYTE_5 "Secondary state-support byte for stock lateral activity. Not yet a standalone boolean, but it moves through stable phase families alongside frame 112 and is useful as corroborating evidence when validating assisted-steering windows.";

