 SG_ LAT_TJA_CYCLE : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ LAT_TJA_BYTE_1 : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ LAT_TJA_BYTE_2 : 16|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" BMW_I3
