 SG_ LAT_TJA_GATE_BYTE_5 : 40|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ LAT_TJA_GATE_BYTE_6 : 48|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ LAT_TJA_GATE_VALID : 46|1@1+ (1,0) [0|1] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ LAT_TJA_DIR_RULE_B1 : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" BMW_I3
 SG_ LAT_TJA_DIR_RULE_B3 : 24|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" BMW_I3
CM_ BO_ 131 "Mixed stock ADAS state/command frame on src0. Current route-backed work treats bytes 3:4 little-endian as the active stock longitudinal target-like field, not as a lateral-angle request. Bytes0/1/2/7/8 are live OEM structural or coded bytes and should be copied through from the real bus template. Bytes5/6 should normally be sent from the host as the active gate 0x80/0x02. Within the managed longitudinal branch, byte3 behaves like an analog modular value, byte4 counts byte3 wrap events, and the combined word at bytes 3:4 little-endian gives the best current stock-compatible target-speed-like value u = byte3 + 256*byte4. Byte1 remains unresolved and should currently be preserved from the OEM frame rather than synthesized.";
CM_ SG_ 131 LAT_TJA_CYCLE "Live OEM cycle/phase byte. Do not synthesize a static value; copy it from the cached real-bus 0x83 template before injection.";
CM_ SG_ 131 LAT_TJA_BYTE_1 "Live OEM unresolved coded byte. Current analysis does not support treating it as analog steering or a simple CRC/checksum, so preserve it from the cached real-bus 0x83 template before injection.";
CM_ SG_ 131 LAT_TJA_BYTE_2 "Live OEM cyclic byte. In active TJA it rolls 0xF0..0xFE with no observed exceptions on validated routes; copy it from the cached real-bus 0x83 template before injection.";
CM_ SG_ 131 LAT_TJA_BYTE_3 "Current best analog stock longitudinal candidate. Treat this as the low byte of the internal target-speed-like value only when paired with LAT_TJA_BYTE_4.";
CM_ SG_ 131 LAT_TJA_BYTE_4 "Slow wrap counter for LAT_TJA_BYTE_3. It increments on byte3 high-to-low wraps (255->0) and decrements on low-to-high wraps (0->255), giving u = byte3 + 256*byte4.";
CM_ SG_ 131 LONG_TARGET_U_83 "Debug-only stock longitudinal target-like value reconstructed as bytes 3:4 little-endian, i.e. u = byte3 + 256*byte4.";
CM_ SG_ 131 LONG_TARGET_SPEED_EST_83 "Debug-only speed estimate from LONG_TARGET_U_83 using the current best cross-route-compatible fit target_speed_kph ~= 0.047815 * u - 1460.510. Use for analysis only, not as a safety-critical actuation law.";
CM_ SG_ 131 LAT_TJA_BYTE_7 "Live OEM structural byte. Do not synthesize a static value; copy it from the cached real-bus 0x83 template before injection.";
CM_ SG_ 131 LAT_TJA_BYTE_8 "Live OEM structural byte. Do not synthesize a static value; copy it from the cached real-bus 0x83 template before injection.";
CM_ SG_ 131 LAT_TJA_GATE_BYTE_5 "Active TJA gate byte. Default host value should be 0x80.";
CM_ SG_ 131 LAT_TJA_GATE_BYTE_6 "Active TJA gate byte. Default host value should be 0x02.";
CM_ SG_ 131 LAT_TJA_GATE_VALID "Debug helper: true when byte5=0x80 and byte6=0x02.";
VAL_ 131 LAT_TJA_GATE_BYTE_5 0 "OFF_GATE" 128 "TJA_ACTIVE_DEFAULT" 131 "ALT_ACTIVE_401_ONLY";
VAL_ 131 LAT_TJA_GATE_BYTE_6 2 "TJA_ACTIVE_DEFAULT" 14 "OFF_GATE";

