CM_ BO_ 769 "Low-rate PT-CAN steering-angle companion on CAN src 2. Treat 770 as the primary live steering-wheel-angle feedback and 769 as a decimated/filtered companion. Current linear scale is centered around raw ~32748 and validated live against about +/-180 deg wheel checkpoints, with raw 37850 ~= +180 deg and raw 27677 ~= -180 deg. Keep the exact OEM semantic split between 769 and 770 open until a dedicated visual steering calibration route confirms the final mapping.";

