CM_ BO_ 770 "Primary PT-CAN steering-wheel-angle candidate on CAN src 2. Raw bytes 2-3 still correlate strongest in the full raw scan and remain the best current live steering feedback source on the i3. Current linear scale is centered around raw ~32748 and validated live against about +/-180 deg wheel checkpoints, with raw 37850 ~= +180 deg and raw 27677 ~= -180 deg. Keep the exact OEM signal name and final physical scaling open until a dedicated visual steering calibration route confirms the mapping.";

